  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Center for Not for Profit Law f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida till   det tre-&#xe5;riga &quot;Civic Space Initiative&quot;. M&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r att     f&#xf6;rsvara och ut&#xf6;ka utrymmet f&#xf6;r det civila samh&#xe4;llet att verka, genom verksamhet som fr&#xe4;mjar en gynnsam r&#xe4;ttslig milj&#xf6; f&#xf6;r                  civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Center for Not for profit Law receives support from     Sida to the &quot;Civic Space Initiative&quot;, with the overall objective to:  &quot;protect and expand civic space by fostering an enabling legal        environment for civil society organizations&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
